# --- Kibo notes -------------------------------------------------------------
# openapi-generator also emits Gradle, SBT, Travis and GitHub-Actions
# scaffolding into every module, which is why the repo carries 24 copies of
# gradle-wrapper.jar for a tree that only ever builds with Maven (see
# Dockerfile). None of it is used.
#
# It is NOT suppressed here because --ignore-file-override does not apply to
# those supporting files in openapi-generator 6.2.0 - only to the templated
# sources below, which is why the test-file and runtime rules above do work.
# Removing them needs --global-property supportingFiles=<explicit list>, which
# is a deliberate change to make on its own rather than as part of a refresh.
